# T-1032: walk_polarity must traverse RowTail::Uniform value type.
# Container[T] has a covariant type parameter. Without the T-1032 fix, the TypeVar
# inside a RowTail::Uniform field would be classified as Phantom instead of Covariant.
# This test verifies that declaring a user-defined parameterized type works without errors.
[
  Container: [type [let v] [value: v]]
  result: 42
]
=== out
Dict({"result": Int(42)})
